{"candidateAnswer":"The outdoors and the natural world","evidence":"[D11:9 | 3:35 pm on 12 May, 2022] Joanna: It was awesome, Nate. The sound of that place and the beauty of nature made me so calm and peaceful. Everything else faded away and all that mattered was the present.\n[D28:23 | 5:54 pm on 9 November, 2022] Nate: That sounds incredible! Nature truly has a way of reminding us to appreciate the beauty around us, and moments like those really stay with you. These critters also make me appreciate life's little joys. And guess what? I got them a new friend!","itemId":"urn:uuid:692e9c9e-630a-5127-8d92-ab93fce7378e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ebaffa94cfbeeef538637176aa2bdddce81a99205eae974987e4163bf826e77c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What do both Joanna and Nate appreciate the beauty of?","referenceAnswer":"Nature","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ebaffa94cfbeeef538637176aa2bdddce81a99205eae974987e4163bf826e77c"}}]}